  "knownValue(-1): throw:EnvelopeError:InvalidParameter:value must be an unsigned 64-bit integer, got -1 <- KnownValuesError:InvalidParameter:value must be an integer in [0, 9007199254740991] or a bigint in [0, 1",
  "setPosition(1.5): throw:EnvelopeError:InvalidParameter:position must be an integer in [0, 9007199254740991] or a bigint in [0",
